        "description": "OFFICER/PRIVILEGED_ADMIN/SYSTEM. Action CREDENTIAL_REGISTRY_REISSUE. ACTIVE|SUSPENDED -> REISSUED (terminal). Successor must be REGISTERED/ACTIVE in the same tenant registry. Optimistic expected_version.",
